{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/lunar-exalted/1296785-forum-lunar-game-attributes-in-unusual-places","id":1296785,"title":"Forum Lunar Game: Attributes in Unusual Places","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Exalted","Lunar Exalted"],"posts":[{"date":"2019-03-14T13:52:44-07:00","id":1296785,"title":"Forum Lunar Game: Attributes in Unusual Places","content":"So, Lunars need to stunt to include off-attributes in their actions for Excellency purposes. This will require practice.<br /> <br /> Thus: A game!<br /> <br /> Give a brief stunt demonstrating how to include a given attribute in a given action, and then provide an attribute and action for the next poster.<br /> <br /> I.E if the previous post requested &quot;Stamina&quot; with &quot;A melee attack (Dexterity + Melee)&quot;, my stunt might be<br /> <br /> &quot;I let the incoming attack glance off my essence-hardend shoulder, forcing an opening for stabination.&quot;<br /> <br /> First up: Charisma and Parry Defense!","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>My Storyteller Vault releases!<br /> <a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/product/269728/Sorcerous-Ways-Mystic-Martial-Arts\" target=\"_blank\">Sorcerous Ways: Mystic Martial Arts</a> - Punch people for magic power!<br /> <a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/product/252892/These-Mean-Streets\" target=\"_blank\">These Mean Streets</a> - Advise and systems for street-level punk-noir Vampire larp","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/169-wastevens","name":"wastevens","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar169_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"939"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-03-14T15:28:05-07:00","id":1296803,"title":"","content":"&quot