ty muscles I carve the poetry deep into the side of the building to catch the awestruck attention of all who pass by&quot;<br /> <br /> Adding manipulation to a strength+athletics attempt to lift a boulder<br /> <br /> Edit: Wow, that took longer to write then I thought it did.<br /> <br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> Intelligence, seducing someone. </div> </div> </div>&quot;Using my vast intelligence to calculate the most likely to be effective seduction method based on what I've read of her cultures courting rituals I compare their eyes to the color of a local flower considered romantic&quot;<br /> <br /> Adding manipulation to a strength+athletics attempt to lift a boulder<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Exalted Whose Name is Carved in Leaves of Jade<br /> Senator of the Greater Chamber<br /> Champion of the Silver Pact<br /> Chosen of the Little Gods<br /> Agent of Fate","edited":{"userid":988,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/988-mizu","user":"Mizu","date":". 03-14-2019, 08:47 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/988-mizu","name":"Mizu","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar988_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1520"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-03-14T23:18:21-07:00","id":1296917,"title":"","content":"<i>&quot;A boulder is just like a person; all you really need is leverage.&quot;</i><br /> <br /> Next: add Dexterity to an (Intelligence + Lore) roll to introduce a fact.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/97-the-mg","name":"The MG","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar97_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2460"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-03-14T23:30:55-07:00","id":1296920,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>The MG</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/lunar-exalted/1296785-forum-lunar-game-attributes-in-unusual-places?p=1296917#post1296917\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><i>&quot;A boulder is just like a person; all you really need is leverage.&quot;</i><br /> <br /> Next: add Dexterity to an (Intelligence + Lore) roll to introduce a fact.</div> </div> </div> </div>While examining a piece of pottery at market, you carefully feel out all of its dimensions, running along its contours and probing its cavities, to introduce a fact about the quality of that form of jar or vase as a storage medium.<br /> <br /> Apply Appearance to the Wits + Occult roll needed to break attunement to a demesne.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"color:#00ffff\">I have approximate knowledge of many things.</span><br /> <a href=\"https://forum.rpg.net/index.php?threads/wip-xenoblade-chronicles-the-sword-can-see-the-future.835575/\" target=\"_blank\">Write up as I play Xenoblade Chronicles.</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/158-isator-levi","name":"Isator Levi","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar158_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"17901"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-03-14T23:32:12-07:00","id":1296921,"title":"","content":"&quot;I sort through the facts in the dirt, developing a sort of storyboard until the answer I seek comes to mind.&quot;<br /> <br /> Next: Give me Appearence on a (Perception + Larceny roll)<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Thoughts ripple out, birthing others","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1624-falleneco","name":"FallenEco","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1624_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1927"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-03-15T00:27:08-07:00","id":1296930,"title":"","content":"Walking down the street, I flash a sparkling grin, and sparkling coins. As I attract everyone's attention, I note who's admiring my chiseled jaw and baby-blue eyes, and whose eyes are instead drawn to my coin-purse.<br /> <br /> Strength on a Join Battle roll.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>STing Bronze Age Exalted","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2402-the-wizard-of-oz","name":"The Wizard of Oz","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2402_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10350"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-03-15T00:54:32-07:00","id":1296931,"title":"","content":"Muscles rippling, I explode in a bolt of sheer kinetic energy, arcing mercilessly towards my prey. All they can do is stand there still slack jawed and glassy eyed.<br /> <br /> Charisma on a Int + Craft (Artifact) roll. (And it can\u2019t be for Adorei, that\u2019s cheating!)","signature":"","edited":{"userid":8959,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8959-prototype00","user":"prototype00","date":". 03-15-2019, 03:59 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8959-prototype00","name":"prototype00","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar8959_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"964"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-03-15T00:59:43-07:00","id":1296932,"title":"","content":"In the forge-temple, hammers ring and sparks fly as apprentices move and work. I stand in the centre, directing them. My loyal apprentices hang on my every word as I direct them. Slowly, the warstrider begins to take shape.<br /> <br /> Intelligence on a Stamina+Resistance roll.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>STing Bronze Age Exalted","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2402-the-wizard-of-oz","name":"The Wizard of Oz","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2402_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10350"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-03-15T03:01:25-07:00","id":1296937,"title":"","content":"&quot;You know the kuji-in breathing exercises that help purge the toxins within yourself, simply meditate upon them, focussing your mind on the flow of air within...&quot;<br /> <br /> Next: Can I get a stunt for Appearence on a Stamina/Resistance roll please?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Thoughts ripple out, birthing others","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1624-falleneco","name":"FallenEco","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1624_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"