kedby":[]},{"date":"2019-03-15T15:58:24-07:00","id":1297103,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Isator Levi</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/lunar-exalted/1296785-forum-lunar-game-attributes-in-unusual-places?p=1296920#post1296920\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Apply Appearance to the Wits + Occult roll needed to break attunement to a demesne.</div> </div> </div> </div>&quot;I carefully dress up and disguise myself as the person whose attunement I'm trying to break. The demesne will get confused because it can't be attuned to two copies of the same person, thus making it easier to break it to them.&quot;<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>shkspr1048</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/lunar-exalted/1296785-forum-lunar-game-attributes-in-unusual-places?p=1297013#post1297013\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Next: Charisma on a roll against water pressure while deep sea diving.</div> </div> </div> </div>&quot;I talk to myself as I dive, reminding myself of all the reasons I need to go this deep, and improving my motivation&quot;<br /> <br /> What about adding Manipulation to an (Strength + Athletics) roll to lift a huge portcullis?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Interested in chatting with other Exalted fans online? Join us 